    "ls|LS16_S11_U_21": " \nGOVERNMENT OF INDIA \nMINISTRY OF ROAD TRANSPORT & HIGHWAYS \n \nLOK SABHA  \n UNSTARRED QUESTION NO. 21 \nANSWERED ON 2ND FEBRUARY, 2017 \n \nROAD OVER BRIDGE ON NATIONAL HIGHWAYS IN TAMIL NADU \n \n21. SHRI PR. SENTHIL NATHAN: \n \n Will the Minister of ROAD TRANSPORT & HIGHWAYS \n \nसड़क परिवहन औि िाजमार्ग मंत्री \n be pleased to state: \n \n(a) whether the Government has conducted/proposed to conduct any study on the \nrequirements of Road Over Bridges, Flyovers, Under Bridges at various National \nHighways (NHs) passing in Tamil Nadu; \n(b) if so, the details and outcomes thereof along with the list of projects underway and \nproposed to be undertaken in the next two years; and \n(c) the funds earmarked/allocated/spent on such projects during each of the last three years \nand the current year, NH-wise? \n \nANSWER \n \nTHE MINISTER OF STATE IN THE \nMINISTRY OF ROAD TRANSPORT AND HIGHWAYS \n \n(SHRI PON. RADHAKRISHNAN) \n \n(a) Yes Madam. \n \n(b) & (c) Ministry has identified various sections of National Highways consisting of 407 \nnumbers of structures which includes Road over Bridge/Flyovers/Grade \nSeparators/Under & Bridges  etc and are at various stages of project preparation & \nimplementation in the State of Tamil Nadu . All those  structures are included in the \ncorridor development and cost of the same is included in the total p roject cost. \nAdditionally 9 ROBs and 4 Structures have beenalso identified as standalone projects. \nA list of all such structures is enclosed as Annexure. \n \n \n  \n\nANNEXURE \nANNEXURE REFERRED TO IN REPLY TO PARA (a) TO  (c ) OF LOK SABHA UNSTARRED QUESTION NO. \n21 FOR ANSWER ON 2ND FEB 2017 ASKED BY SHRI PR. SENTHIL NATHAN REDARDING ROADS OVER \nBRIDGE ON NATIONAL HIGHWAYS IN TAMIL NADU \nS.No. NH No. Name of Stretch / Km \nRoad over \nBridges \n(Nos.) \nFlyover / \nVehicular \nOverpasses \n(Nos.) \nGrade \nSeparators/ \nInterchanges ( \nNo.) \n \nVehicular \nUnder \npasses \n(No) \nPede